Source: frp
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: freshdeb <packages@freshdeb.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 help2man,
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/fatedier/frp
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: frps
Architecture: any
Depends:
 adduser,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: fast reverse proxy to expose local servers behind NAT (server)
 frp exposes local servers behind a NAT or firewall to the internet: frpc
 connects out to frps, and frps forwards connections to it (TCP, UDP, HTTP
 and HTTPS with virtual hosts, STCP/XTCP between clients, and more).
 .
 This package contains frps, the server, with its web dashboard. The
 service is installed but not enabled: configure /etc/frp/frps.toml first.

Package: frpc
Architecture: any
Depends:
 adduser,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: fast reverse proxy to expose local servers behind NAT (client)
 frp exposes local servers behind a NAT or firewall to the internet: frpc
 connects out to frps, and frps forwards connections to it (TCP, UDP, HTTP
 and HTTPS with virtual hosts, STCP/XTCP between clients, and more).
 .
 This package contains frpc, the client, with its admin web UI. The
 service is installed but not enabled: configure /etc/frp/frpc.toml first.
